-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- the hop by spectral projectors, each space computed once
-- A term is Σ_{μ₁, μ₂ ≠ 0} (μ₁μ₂)^{1/8} · map(P_{μ₁}, P_{μ₂}), the ½ of the two 1/√2 in the kind's coefficient.
-- The vertex spaces the terms visit, each with its M and its eigenvalues (and the check that Π(M − ν) = 0 on it),
-- are computed once and looked up.
SpaceData : Type
SpaceData = List Nat × (VM × (List SQ × Bool))
